-"If we only had a ball --
a small, rubber ball --

1546
01:06:09,653 --> 01:06:11,378
then we'd be fine."
-"Wait.

1547
01:06:11,412 --> 01:06:12,791
I think I know where
we can find one."

1548
01:06:12,826 --> 01:06:14,378
-Professor, are you sure
we're doing the right thing

1549
01:06:14,412 --> 01:06:15,895
