1550
01:06:15,929 --> 01:06:17,895
-Right or wrong, I don't know.

1551
01:06:17,929 --> 01:06:21,343
What I do know is, it's wrong
to stay down in the village.

1552
01:06:21,378 --> 01:06:23,791
Up there, we stand some chance,
at least.

1553
01:06:23,826 --> 01:06:25,136
-Professor, look,

1554
01:06:25,171 --> 01:06:28,584
