what we're dealing with.

1567
01:07:07,274 --> 01:07:10,860
-Well, we'll know soon enough.

1568
01:07:10,895 --> 01:07:13,653
-Wow, is that tastelessly done.

1569
01:07:13,688 --> 01:07:17,240
It's such a mishmash of styles.

1570
01:07:17,274 --> 01:07:20,929
-Kind of garish all around.
