1574
01:07:30,067 --> 01:07:32,412
-No, that's the little ball.
-Oh.

1575
01:07:32,446 --> 01:07:41,653
♪♪

1576
01:07:41,688 --> 01:07:43,412
-See, now this is where
your weatherizing

1577
01:07:43,446 --> 01:07:44,895
would really pay off.

1578
01:07:44,929 --> 01:07:47,136
They're probably losing up to70% of their heat out that door.

1579
01:07:47,171 --> 01:07:49,895
-Seems to have stopped
at the hotel.

1580
01:07:49,929 --> 01:07:52,826
-Yeah, well, as long as it staysthere, we're all right.

1581
01:07:52,860 --> 01:07:56,102
Least that cloud lets us see
where it moves.

1582
01:07:58,929 --> 01:08:01,791
Let's get aboard as quickly
as possible, please.

1583
01:08:01,826 --> 01:08:05,067
That's it.
Hurry along.

1584
01:08:05,102 --> 01:08:06,481
Please, ma'am.

1585
01:08:06,515 --> 01:08:08,309
Please.
-My kid.

1586
01:08:08,343 --> 01:08:10,240
Where's my kid?

1587
01:08:10,274 --> 01:08:11,653
-Of course, the child!

1588
01:08:15,343 --> 01:08:16,619
-If that cloud starts to move
this way

1589
01:08:16,653 --> 01:08:18,136
before I get back,
take the car up.

1590
01:08:18,171 --> 01:08:19,205
Do you understand?

1591
01:08:19,240 --> 01:08:21,550
-What about you?
-Do as you're told!

1592
01:08:21,584 --> 01:08:24,067
-Too late.

1593
01:08:26,619 --> 01:08:28,584
-Whoa!
Holy -- What the --

1594
01:08:28,619 --> 01:08:31,688
Geez!

1595
01:08:31,722 --> 01:08:32,998
