1596
01:08:33,033 --> 01:08:35,757
-He thinks that ball's
one of his pupils.

1597
01:08:35,791 --> 01:08:37,136
-Ha ha.
-Oh, sorry, couldn't resist.

1598
01:08:37,171 --> 01:08:39,791
