1602
01:08:49,826 --> 01:08:53,378
-"Now look here, you!"

1603
01:08:53,412 --> 01:08:57,791
"Give you a trim."

1604
01:08:57,826 --> 01:09:01,067
-Hey, wait!
What about the ball?

1605
01:09:01,102 --> 01:09:04,860
[Speaking German]

1606
01:09:04,895 --> 01:09:06,446
-Tell her that Mister --

1607
01:09:10,067 --> 01:09:11,895
-"Hey."

1608
01:09:11,929 --> 01:09:15,274
-Get in the cable car.

1609
01:09:15,309 --> 01:09:16,998
-"Tickets.

1610
01:09:17,033 --> 01:09:18,343
Everyone?"

1611
01:09:18,378 --> 01:09:21,205
-"I don't need one."
-Forrest Tucker.

1612
01:09:26,205 --> 01:09:28,550
Oh, look, it feel off
its fabric-softener box.

1613
01:09:28,584 --> 01:09:31,895
