across the room.

1731
01:14:50,722 --> 01:14:53,102
I turned the car and came back.

1732
01:14:53,136 --> 01:14:56,067
-You all right?

1733
01:14:56,102 --> 01:14:58,653
-"Couldn't get it out
of first, huh?"

1734
01:14:58,688 --> 01:15:00,584
-Yes, I'm all right, thank you.

1735
01:15:03,757 --> 01:15:05,653
It is so hot in here.

1736
01:15:05,688 --> 01:15:07,481
-Uh-oh.

1737
01:15:07,515 --> 01:15:08,929
-Stay here with
the others, Hans.

1738
01:15:08,964 --> 01:15:10,274
You'll be all right soon.

1739
01:15:10,309 --> 01:15:12,481
-And don't breathe on anybody.

1740
01:15:13,860 --> 01:15:22,033
♪♪

1741
01:15:22,067 --> 01:15:23,619
-"What is it, my breath?"

1742
01:15:23,653 --> 01:15:31,033
♪♪

1743
01:15:31,067 --> 01:15:33,619
-The Certs encounter.

1744
01:15:33,653 --> 01:15:36,378
-♪ Young love, first love

1745
01:15:36,412 --> 01:15:40,067
-♪ Wah wah, whoo

1746
01:15:40,102 --> 01:15:42,378
-Anne, where are you going?

1747
01:15:42,412 --> 01:15:44,102
-I'm just going to
sit down in the office.

1748
01:15:44,136 --> 01:15:45,757
-All right.

1749
01:15:48,102 --> 01:15:49,481
But how can Anne help?

1750
01:15:49,515 --> 01:15:52,240
She doesn't know anything.
-Obviously.

1751
01:15:52,274 --> 01:15:54,274
-We don't know for sure
that she can, but, Sarah,

1752
01:15:54,309 --> 01:15:56,412
we've got to try something.

1753
01:15:56,446 --> 01:15:58,998
Obviously, she has some kind
of contact with these things...

1754
01:15:59,033 --> 01:16:01,584
-Obviously.-...whether she knows it or not.

1755
01:16:01,619 --> 01:16:04,240
I thought perhaps with you
controlling her thinking, we --

1756
01:16:04,274 --> 01:16:05,757
well, we might be able
to learn something

1757
01:16:05,791 --> 01:16:08,102
about what we're dealing with.

1758
01:16:08,136 --> 01:16:09,481
-I suppose we could try.

1759
01:16:09,515 --> 01:16:12,584
-Maybe that's what those eyes
want is contacts.

1760
01:16:12,619 --> 01:16:14,791
-It's going down all the time.

